# Blizanci Roadmap

A notional roadmap for Blizanci, as of April 2026 / v5.5.1

## Phase 1 (v6.*)

* better logging
* proper support for latest TLS given client certificates

## Phase 2 (v7.*)

* better config/routing/auth API
* SNI support
* conversion to library

## Phase 3 (v8.*)

* caching
* directory indexing
* better packaging (e.g., docker, documentation)
